# EXPORT AS SQL without a table exports every table: each table's CREATE TABLE
# and INSERT statements, with the tables ordered so that a table comes after
# the tables it references (otherwise by name).

# With no tables there is nothing to export.
> EXPORT AS SQL
---
ok

